OL,3,GNEWSATown's art gallery set to welcome
OL,4,Aback visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art gallery will welcome visitors
OL,7,Ffor the first time in more than five
OL,8,Fyears by displaying a collection of
OL,9,Fwork by local artists.
OL,11,FThe Alfred East Art Gallery in
OL,12,FKettering, Northamptonshire, closed to
OL,13,Fthe public in mid-2021 for
OL,14,Fredevelopment and later required
OL,15,Fextensive roof repairs following rain
OL,16,Fdamage in 2023.
OL,18,FThe gallery is part of a cultural hub,
OL,19,Fcollectively known as Cornerstone,
OL,20,Fwhich also includes its library, museum
OL,21,Fand garden.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
