OL,3,GNEWSATown's art gallery set to welcome
OL,4,Aback visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said
OL,7,Fthat the new display, titled Prelude,
OL,8,Fwould be located within the rear
OL,9,Fextension of the building from 5
OL,10,FSeptember to 2 October ahead of the
OL,11,Ffull reopening to coincide with
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Day.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
